name emotion
category Package
revision 69834
shortdesc Make emojis more easy to use in XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
relocated 1
longdesc There are many emojis with long names, and we cannot remember
longdesc them all. At the same time, when we type an emoji, we want to
longdesc see what it looks like in text editor. Now, you do not need to
longdesc remember the emoji name, just select it from the keyboard and
longdesc wrap it with \emotion. Unlike other emoji packages, you can
longdesc thus use emojis more easily and flexibly.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/emotion/emotion.def
 RELOC/tex/latex/emotion/emotion.sty
catalogue-contact-bugs https://github.com/ourfor/LaTeX-emotion/issues
catalogue-contact-home https://github.com/ourfor/LaTeX-emotion
catalogue-contact-repository https://github.com/ourfor/LaTeX-emotion.git
catalogue-ctan /macros/unicodetex/latex/emotion
catalogue-license apache2
catalogue-topics expl3
catalogue-version 0.2
